WEBVTT

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:06.154
Yaa Dafra tẽn-sõamyã. Yaa Bobo-Dioulasso kibarã.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:13.392
Kẽer sẽn be Houet kʋɩlgã pʋgẽ wã, koomã ra yaa wa ko-kãseng wakat fãa.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:16.416
Kẽer yaa zĩm-dãmb sẽn tar gãn-kãsemse.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:32.450
Daar a ye, b sẽn da wa n naan tẽngã, koglg ned sẽn da tar koomã yãee zĩ-kãng. A rɩka bõn-yũudr la a bas kũun n na n pʋʋs Wẽnnaam barka.

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:40.496
Tẽnga sẽn be ko-kãsengã sɛɛgẽ wã yaa Sya, b sẽn da boond tɩ Bobo-Dioulasso.

00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:50.560
Tẽngã neba ra wa n baooda koom Dafra, la b da pa yĩm ne zĩmã rɩɩb ye.

00:01:02.000 --> 00:01:07.546
A Awa, a Sya pagã ra pa tar bi-ribl ye. A sũur yɩɩ toog wʋsgo.

00:01:10.000 --> 00:01:13.760
Daar a ye koabgẽ, a kẽnga koglgã pʋga.

00:01:18.000 --> 00:01:21.120
A Dafra gũudã ra gũuda yẽnda be.

00:01:24.000 --> 00:01:27.008
Dafra Silures, m kot-y tɩ y kõ maam biiga.

00:01:30.000 --> 00:01:32.000
Tẽeg-y y pʋlengã, la y gũ.

00:01:35.000 --> 00:01:38.882
Kẽer n yi koomã pʋgẽ. B wʋma pʋlemdã.

00:01:45.000 --> 00:01:52.866
La ka la bilfu, Awa rɩka a biigã. A leb n waame n na n pʋʋs a Zeova barka.

00:02:08.000 --> 00:02:12.560
La daar a ye, zĩm-biisi sẽn yit tẽn-zẽnga waame.

00:02:17.000 --> 00:02:21.426
Ka ned sẽn baood zĩm-gãong ye. Rɩt-kãens yaa bõn-sõamyã.

00:02:23.000 --> 00:02:25.826
A yãgsame. A lob-a lame n dɩ zĩm a ye.

00:02:40.000 --> 00:02:45.546
A kẽnga be, a sũur yɩɩ noog ne-a. A Zezi poore, saasẽ lebga lik.

00:02:52.000 --> 00:02:54.176
Rẽ n so tɩ koom-koglgã sa.

00:03:03.000 --> 00:03:12.930
A Sya pʋgẽ, b pa kõ-b bũmb ye. Neb nins sẽn da be tẽn-kãnga pʋgẽ wã yii koom koglgẽ n lebg n wa ne b nusã.

00:03:16.000 --> 00:03:20.272
La zĩm-biisã sẽn da be zĩig sẽn zãre wã, bãaga yõk-b lame.

00:03:32.000 --> 00:03:35.504
A Zezi sẽn wa n zãad ne b nugã, a lebgame.

00:03:38.600 --> 00:03:41.810
Bas-y maam, gũudã. M da pa mi ye.

00:03:44.000 --> 00:03:48.746
A kɩtame tɩ zĩmã leb koomẽ. A Ma wãbda zĩm-dãmbã.

00:03:52.000 --> 00:03:57.914
La koomã lebg n waame. Tẽngã neb waame tao-tao n na n maan sũ-noogo.

00:04:17.000 --> 00:04:23.160
Rũndã-rũndã me, neb nins sẽn wa n be Dafra wã rɩtda rũmsã, la b kõt-b-la b pʋlemsã.
